### Dashboard 1: Overview

![Overview Dashboard](/assets/images/GCSE_overview.png)

A high‑level overview of key data and demographics.  
Impact scores are presented in KPI cards at the top of the page.  
The main column chart shows whole‑school grade distribution, while progress through the mock series is tracked in the bottom‑left line chart.  
Donut charts provide demographic breakdowns, and the bottom‑right scatter chart shows the relationship between attendance and average GCSE score — with performance declining below the government’s 95% attendance benchmark.
